        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I just called, but they
accepted my application right
away.)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I guess they're really 
short-handed in spring...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Family Restaurant "Dixie's".
I'll be working here from
today on, huh?...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right then... What should
I do first?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>？？？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Welcome!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Are you here by
yourself, mister?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Whoa, what a beautiful girl!
She looks so mature... Is she a
college student? No! This is
not the time for this!)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>How may I help you?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Um... I will be working
part-time here from today
on...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Eh? Ah, are you a new
employee?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Please come here.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Employees are not allowed to
use the customers' entrance,
you know?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm sorry...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe, it's all right. After
all, it's your first day.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Anegasaki</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Anegasaki Nene, Pleased to
meet you.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm ▲苗字▲ ▲名前▲.
Pleased to meet you, too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I suppose I'm a year ahead
of you, both here and at
school, right?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>In school?... Excuse me, but
I have just transferred here.
How do you know...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe. Sorry, I heard from the
manager that a junior from my
high school would come to work
here.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah, is that so?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hmm... I guess you're still
nervous?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Why do you say so?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>The way you speak to me. Even
though I'm just a year older,
you don't have to be so polite,
okay？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Excuse m- No, I'm sorry. I
guess I'm still a bit nervous.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah, it's all right. Just don't
forget to be polite to the
customers.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>We're pretty strict about that
sort of thing here. You understand,
right?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes ma-!... I mean, sure.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe. Alright, I'm heading
back for now. Can you wait
here？ The manager should be
here soon.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Okay, thanks.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe, you're welcome.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Looks like this part-time job
will be fun...)</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
      </SDL2>
