        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I just called, but they
accepted my application right
away.)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I don't want to be late on my
first day at work. It's hot,
but I must hurry...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Family Restaurant "Dixie's".
I'll be working here from
today on, huh？...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Um, I guess this is the
place...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>？？？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, then.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hahh... It's so hot. Having
to take out the trash on a day
like this... I'm just so over it...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Um...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah... Could you be...
The new employee？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(What a beautiful lady...
She looks mature. No！ This is
not the time for this！)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes. My name is
▲苗字▲ ▲名前▲.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Anegasaki</Dialog>
          <Dialog>My name is Anegasaki Nene.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe, I guess you overheard me
mumbling.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah, I was asked to give you
guidance. Let's work hard
together.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Okay, Anegasaki-san.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>This is my first job and I've
just moved in. I will have to
learn a lot from you. So
please take care of me.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, is that so?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Hmm. I think you're too
formal.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Eh?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You should be formal to the
customers. But you can talk
normally to me, okay?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But you are my senior...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>That's what I mean. Look!
Do I look too grown-up
to you?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>So, when someone around my own
age speaks to me so formally,
it's just a bit... you know?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>How old are you then,
Anegasaki-san?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm a third-year at the same high
school as you. The manager told
me that a junior would be coming in.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Eh?! You're a high school
student?!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Yeah. I know. Everyone
reacts like that.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No, it's not what... I mean
you're so pretty. That's why I
thought you were much older...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Now you're flattering me?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No. But... Umm...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Okay, from now on, don't be
too formal. Do that and I'll
forgive you.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Okay... Sure. I'll try.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe. It's nice to meet you
then. Now, let's get inside.
I'll explain everything to you.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Looks like this part-time job
will be fun...)</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
